{
  "notes": [
    "The left half of a fine-dining table: round, in a white cloth that falls in folds to the floor, a tall candle in a silver holder at its left and a glass of red wine at its right.",
    "Place both halves by pixel (px) on one point, the middle of its top: the food stands there, placed after it. Its legs run out of the brief's box at the bottom.",
